# Large source documents (>60 MB) are hosted in the shared Google Drive folder
# instead of the repo, to save Git space. The site links to them via
# EXTERNAL_SOURCE_DOCS in assets/app.js; scripts/generate_source_manifest.py
# keeps them out of the manifest via SOURCE_MAX_BYTES. Keep the two in step.
Supporting Documents/Sabbath History.pdf
Supporting Documents/Quote 52 - The_Catholic_Encyclopedia.pdf
Supporting Documents/Protestant Quote_36 - Ductor Dubitantium Bishop Jeremy Taylor.pdf
Supporting Documents/Quote_49-Patrologi-cursus_completus.pdf
Supporting Documents/THE_CATHOLIC_EDUCATOR_A_LIBRARY_OF_CATHOLIC_INSTRUCTION_AND_DEVOTIONClaim_Pope_can_change_divine_law.pdf
Supporting Documents/Early Church Quote_4 - patrologiae_cursus_completus_gr_vol_023.pdf
Supporting Documents/Quote_25-Faith_of_Millions_page_147_sunday_claim_6th_edition_1938.pdf
Supporting Documents/Protestant Quote_61 - systematictheolo014257mbp.pdf
Supporting Documents/Protestant Quote_57 - religiousencyclo04herz.pdf

# Combined whole-Bible JSON files (<X>_bible.json, ~143 MB total) are NOT read
# by the verse lookup — it fetches the per-book files under <X>_books/ so a
# single verse never pulls a whole translation. Excluded to keep the repo lean.
Bible Translations Lookup/*/*_bible.json

# Python bytecode from scripts/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# API credentials. This repository is served publicly by GitHub Pages, so a
# secret committed here would be readable at a public URL. Keep them out.
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
egw-credentials.json
scripts/.egw-token-cache.json

# EGW lookup: the whole-work files duplicate the per-chapter ones and are only
# a convenience for offline use. Same rule as the Bible lookup, where the
# monolithic *_bible.json are ignored and the per-book files are tracked.
EGW Writings Lookup/*/*_book.json
scripts/.egw-probe-ids.json

# Internal working notes. Kept locally, but never published: GitHub Pages
# serves every tracked file, so these were readable at a public URL even
# though nothing linked to them.
DOCUMENT_VERIFICATION_STATUS.md
WEBSITE_REVAMP_REPORT.md
